
>> shop := (Sõnastik uus
	pane: ['magazine'] kohale: ['books'],
	pane: ['computer'] kohale: ['electronics'],
	pane: ['lipstick'] kohale: ['cosmetics']
).
Väljund kirjuta: (shop sisaldab: ['computer']), reavahetus. 
Väljund kirjuta: (shop sisaldab: ['sausage']), reavahetus. 
Väljund kirjuta: (shop sisaldab: ['computers']), reavahetus. 
Väljund kirjuta: (shop sisaldab: ['compute']), reavahetus. 
Väljund kirjuta: (shop sisaldab: ['2computer']), reavahetus. 
